; ncrypt.dll import surface for the Promise Windows zero-dependency link
; surface (T0772). Provides the CNG key-storage entry points the SChannel TLS
; backend uses to import a PEM private key as a named CNG key (T1598,
; compiler/internal/codegen/pal/tls_windows.go). A CNG key (rather than a legacy
; CAPI CSP key) is what lets SChannel offer TLS 1.3 server-side, since 1.3
; requires RSA-PSS signatures that legacy CSPs cannot produce. ncrypt.dll ships
; with every Windows install. See kernel32.def header.
LIBRARY ncrypt.dll
EXPORTS
NCryptDeleteKey
NCryptFreeObject
NCryptImportKey
NCryptOpenStorageProvider
